{'symbol': 'AES', 'date': '2023-06-07 06:20:00', 'title': 'AES ACQUIRES LARGEST PERMITTED SOLAR-PLUS-STORAGE PROJECT IN THE UNITED STATES', 'text': 'STRENGTHENS POSITION AS A LEADER IN PROVIDING RENEWABLE ENERGY TO CORPORATE CUSTOMERS ARLINGTON, VA. , JUNE 7, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE AES CORPORATION (NYSE: AES) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE ACQUISITION OF THE 2 GW BELLEFIELD PROJECT, WHICH IS CURRENTLY IN LATE-STAGE DEVELOPMENT, AND IS THE LARGEST PERMITTED SOLAR-PLUS-STORAGE PROJECT IN THE UNITED STATES.'}